# LJ liquid near the triple point: melt, cool to T* = 0.722, NVT hold, then
# 10k NVE steps with the thermostat off. Used for g(r), thermostat settling
# and NVE energy drift.
vproc       1 1 2
InitUcell   16 16 8
Density     0.8442
InitTemp    2.0
DeltaT      0.005
StepAvg     10
Thermostat  1
TauT        0.1
TMelt       2.0
StepMelt    2000
TQuench     0.722
StepQuench  1000
StepHold    4000
StepNVE     10000
XYZInterval 500
XYZPrefix   nve
